    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "***CASH BUYERS ONLY***\n\nKelly Hudson Properties present this mid terraced one bedroom townhouse to the market.\n\nThis property comes to the market offering bright and airy living accommodation and has been well maintained by its current owners. Located in the shadows of the historic St. Brigid's Cathedral in Kildare town centre, this town centre townhouse boasts of an open plan kitchen/dining/living area, one bathroom and one double bedroom.\n\nSituated in the heart of Kildare Town, this property is within walking distance to all local amenities including leading supermarket chains including Tesco, Lidl and Aldi together with both primary and secondary schools, creches, pubs, restaurants, churches. Kildare Town has a regular bus timetable and the train station is c.10 minute walk making it an ideal location for commuters. Kildare Town is also home to the Irish National Stud & Japanese Gardens and Kildare Village Outlet to name but a few. The larger town of Newbridge is c.15 minute drive away.\n\nViewing comes recommended strictly by prior appointment only.\n\nACCOMMODATION:\n\nKitchen/Dining/Living Area: Wooden flooring, light fitting, fully fitted kitchen, area fully plumbed, oven, hob, extractor fan, stainless steel sink, radiator, velux window, electric storage heater\n\nBedroom: Wooden flooring, light fitting, electric storage heater \n\nBathroom: Wooden flooring, light fitting, corner shower unit, WHB, WC, shaving light and socket\n\nFeatures:\n\nElectric storage heating\nMains water\nMains sewage\nRe-Built in 2010 (Original constructed in 1900's)\nc.30.53sqmt\n\nVIEWING IS STRICTLY BY APPOINTMENT ONLY.\n\nThe above particulars are issued by Kelly Hudson Properties on the understanding that all negotiations are conducted through them. Every care is taken in preparing particulars that are issued for guidance only and the firm do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracies."
      },
